<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>假热假寒 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E5%81%87%E7%83%AD%E5%81%87%E5%AF%92/</link><description>Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 10:11:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lruihao.cn/tags/%E5%81%87%E7%83%AD%E5%81%87%E5%AF%92/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>真治法：论真热真寒</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/2-14-zhenzhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 10:10:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/2-14-zhenzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%90%E9%9B%86/">卷二乐集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“真治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;真热与真寒&lt;/strong&gt;的辨证与正治法则。与“假治法”相对，真治法针对寒热本质与表象一致的病证，&lt;strong&gt;直接以寒治热、以热治寒&lt;/strong&gt;，不须反佐巧服。</description></item><item><title>假治法：论假热假寒</title><link>https://lruihao.cn/posts/2-13-jiazhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 09:22:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://lruihao.cn/posts/2-13-jiazhifa/</guid><category domain="https://lruihao.cn/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%90%E9%9B%86/">卷二乐集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“假治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;真寒假热、真热假寒&lt;/strong&gt;等寒热真假错杂证的辨识与治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;以假治假，顺其假象而引药直达病所&lt;/strong&gt;。真寒假热者，热药冷服，佐苦寒之品为向导；真热假寒者，寒药热服，佐辛热之品为先锋。</description></item></channel></rss>